            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Alfred Nobel</strong><br>\nAlfred Nobel was born in Stockholm, Sweden, in 1833. His family was not wealthy as his father was an inventor and builder who struggled with business failures. Despite the financial troubles, Nobel's parents valued education, and he showed an interest in engineering and explosives from a young age. His family moved to Russia when he was nine, where his father's new armaments factory prospered during the Crimean War.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Nobel's Interest in Explosives</strong><br>\nAlfred Nobel's fascination with explosives began early and was influenced by his father's work in engineering and weapons manufacturing. He conducted experiments with nitroglycerin, a highly volatile liquid, to develop safer and more manageable forms of explosives. Nobel's curiosity led to an important invention that would define his career: dynamite.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Invention of Dynamite</strong><br>\nAfter several dangerous experiments and unfortunate accidents, including one that took the life of his younger brother, Nobel invented dynamite in 1867. This new invention used a safer form of nitroglycerin, stabilized with an inert substance. Dynamite rapidly gained popularity for its use in construction, mining, and the building of infrastructure.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
